Z||000003||stimpy||04-02-2000||10:18 PM||||batboys pic looks so much like my car, I wondered where I left it!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Actually Monkeyman might still have a pic of my car to post to see what a badly faded gold can be brought back to with some wet sanding and wax. My bumpers were so faded, they looked like they where primered. <BR>Red over gold souds like an interesting combo (49ers fan?) but anytime you do a color change it gives a paint shop so many more opportunities to screw things up. I w thinking of going yellow until I have seen some cars that where changed. Now I am leaning to a more subtle change like a lexus champagne gold monochromatic (no silver on the ground effects) Saving my nickles and dimes...||||reg||1
